            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Premature babies are particularly vulnerable and exposed to pain and discomfort. To improve the quality of care, an alliance of skills between nurses, children's nurses and the psychomotor therapist has been set up in a neonatal intensive care unit.</AbstractText>
